DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
9504::$$$message_0072_0000_0000$$$::I come to the rooftop for no particular reason.[lr]::
9505::$$$message_0072_0000_0001$$$::The weather is good, and as I think of sunbathing at the deserted rooftop to take my mind off things...[wait canskip=0 time=500][lr]::
9506::$$$message_0072_0000_0002$$$::...Hold on.::
9507::$$$message_0072_0001_0000$$$::"Hello? What are you guys doing?"[lr]::
9508::$$$message_0072_0001_0001$$$::"Oh. Shirou."[lr]::
9509::$$$message_0072_0001_0002$$$::"Leysritt. You could've ignored him."::
9510::$$$message_0072_0002_0000$$$::The maid in black approaches me without any caution like a baby chick, along with the maid in blue that comes with blatantly open hostility.[lr]::
9511::$$$message_0072_0002_0001$$$::The one in black that is speaking broken Japanese is Leysritt... Illya calls her Leys... And, the one in blue that's aloof is Sella.[lr]::
9512::$$$message_0072_0002_0002$$$::The two of them are maids of the Einzbern Castle and take care of Illya, but it's needless to say that they shouldn't be seen at school.::
9513::$$$message_0072_0003_0000$$$::"Good. Shirou should know."[lr]::
9514::$$$message_0072_0003_0001$$$::"Wait a minute, Leysritt. We do not have to get his help; this is our job. You get back."[lr]::
9515::$$$message_0072_0003_0002$$$::Sella declares.[lr]::
9516::$$$message_0072_0003_0003$$$::Leys backs down downheartedly.::
9517::$$$message_0072_0004_0000$$$::"Good day, then.[lr]::
9518::$$$message_0072_0004_0001$$$::Please keep it a secret that you saw us."[lr]::
9519::$$$message_0072_0004_0002$$$::"...Well, of course I won't tell anyone at school.[lr]::
9520::$$$message_0072_0004_0003$$$::But you should've at least changed into normal clothes before coming here. It's good that it was me, but if someone else came, it would've become a big deal."::
9521::$$$message_0072_0005_0000$$$::"There is no need for your concern. We have cast magecraft to protect ourselves from people. The only ones who can be aware of us are those who carry magecraft, which there are only a few of in this town."::
9522::$$$message_0072_0006_0000$$$::"Oh really? That's true, you guys would've been found if that weren't the case. There are teachers in the faculty room even if it's a weekend, and you could be found by the track members too.[lr]::
9523::$$$message_0072_0006_0001$$$::I see, so you two are generally acting undercover..."[lr]::
9524::$$$message_0072_0006_0002$$$::...Wait, hold on.[lr]::
9525::$$$message_0072_0006_0003$$$::[font italic=true]But, what about that...?[font italic=false]::
9526::$$$message_0072_0007_0000$$$::"Um. Is that the same for Leys?"[lr]::
9527::$$$message_0072_0007_0001$$$::"Yes it is, but what about it?"[lr]::
9528::$$$message_0072_0007_0002$$$::"Well...um, Leys is..."[lr]::
9529::$$$message_0072_0007_0003$$$::"What is it? Please do tell if you do not mind."::
9530::$$$message_0072_0008_0000$$$::"Uh. She buys cake at the shopping district in that outfit, but that's fine?"[lr]::
9531::$$$message_0072_0008_0001$$$::"...That is very insightful.[lr]::
9532::$$$message_0072_0008_0002$$$::I'd like to ask, was that only one time? Or is that often?"::
9533::$$$message_0072_0009_0000$$$::"Well, it's not like it's that often.[lr]::
9534::$$$message_0072_0009_0001$$$::It's like once a week."[lr]::
9535::$$$message_0072_0009_0002$$$::"Leysritt!"[lr]::
9536::$$$message_0072_0009_0003$$$::"...It okay. Everyone friends. Shirou translates for me."::
9537::$$$message_0072_0010_0000$$$::"That is even more of a problem![lr]::
9538::$$$message_0072_0010_0001$$$::...Geez, I was wondering where you were getting such a cheap thing, but I did not think it was from a cake shop in that miscellaneous shopping district..."::
9539::$$$message_0072_0011_0000$$$::"...Yes. Should I stop?"[lr]::
9540::$$$message_0072_0011_0001$$$::"That is not a problem. Get a catalog from them; we shall get delivery from now on.[lr]::
9541::$$$message_0072_0011_0002$$$::Yes, that is more smart."::
9542::$$$message_0072_0012_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
9543::$$$message_0072_0012_0001$$$::I can't tell if those two get along or not, but it's clear that they are amusing people.[lr]::
9544::$$$message_0072_0012_0002$$$::So, what are those amusing people doing here?[lr]::
9545::$$$message_0072_0012_0003$$$::"...You're not looking for that cake shop here, are you?"[lr]::
9546::$$$message_0072_0012_0004$$$::The cake shop, Beko-chan, that you're looking for is far in the distance, twenty kilometers away.::
9547::$$$message_0072_0013_0000$$$::"No. Looking for something."[lr]::
9548::$$$message_0072_0013_0001$$$::"It does not concern you. I am letting you know so that there are no misunderstandings, but neither Leysritt nor I have any interest in this school.[lr]::
9549::$$$message_0072_0013_0002$$$::The only reason we came to such a lowly place was because you..."::
9550::$$$message_0072_0014_0000$$$::Sella closes her mouth, as if she had let her tongue slip.[lr]::
9551::$$$message_0072_0014_0001$$$::"Huh? Me?"[lr]::
9552::$$$message_0072_0014_0002$$$::...Hmm. Apparently I'm playing a role in the reason the two are at the rooftop.::
9553::$$$message_0072_0015_0000$$$::"...Yes. I cannot let such a thing repeat itself. In order to prevent an accident from happening, I must investigate the cause."[lr]::
9554::$$$message_0072_0015_0001$$$::Sella nods to herself.[lr]::
9555::$$$message_0072_0015_0002$$$::...I'm starting to have a bad feeling. My precognition towards man-made disasters have been going up these days.::
9556::$$$message_0072_0016_0000$$$::"...Uh, I will excuse myself then. I won't ask what you're doing, but go on enjoying the rooftop view."[lr]::
9557::$$$message_0072_0016_0001$$$::"Hold on a minute, Master Emiya.[lr]::
9558::$$$message_0072_0016_0002$$$::This is off topic, but is the bag that you are holding what you call lunch?"::
9559::$$$message_0072_0017_0000$$$::That's way off topic.[lr]::
9560::$$$message_0072_0017_0001$$$::That aside, what I'm holding is unmistakably a lunch box. I made it on a whim before leaving the house and ended up bringing it with me.::
9561::$$$message_0072_0018_0000$$$::"Lunch...? Sella, is Shirou yummy?"[lr]::
9562::$$$message_0072_0018_0001$$$::"According to the Mistress, it is something irreplaceable.[lr]::
9563::$$$message_0072_0018_0002$$$::The Mistress who is particular about food says so, so there must be no doubt that it is superb."[lr]::
9564::$$$message_0072_0018_0003$$$::"...[rep fliplr=0 storages=セラ01a(中),リズ01a(近) time=300 flipud=0 poss=c,r bg=o屋上-(昼) indexes=1000,2000][say storage=sch0414_riz_0060 name=リズ]Shirou, eat."::
9565::$$$message_0072_0019_0000$$$::"Woah woah woah, back up...!"[lr]::
9566::$$$message_0072_0019_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
9567::$$$message_0072_0019_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
9568::$$$message_0072_0019_0003$$$::...Um.[lr]::
9569::$$$message_0072_0019_0004$$$::They're staring over here for some reason.[lr]::
9570::$$$message_0072_0019_0005$$$::Leys is...just after my lunch.[lr]::
9571::$$$message_0072_0019_0006$$$::On the other hand, Sella's gaze has some evil mysteriousness. Those are a rival's eyes that are trying to corner me the moment she finds an opening.::
9572::$$$message_0072_0020_0000$$$::"A-Anyway, see ya! I'll go to the castle soon, so I'll see you then!"::
9573::$$$message_0072_0021_0000$$$::"...Phew."[lr]::
9574::$$$message_0072_0021_0001$$$::I escape to the classroom and catch my breath.[lr]::
9575::$$$message_0072_0021_0002$$$::There was no need to run away, but the rooftop is not the most effective topography wise.[lr]::
9576::$$$message_0072_0021_0003$$$::That is a demon's gate for Shirou Emiya.[lr]::
9577::$$$message_0072_0021_0004$$$::I've gotten into the habit of losing because I'm always teased by Tohsaka.::
9578::$$$message_0072_0022_0000$$$::"In that regard, this is my territory."[lr]::
9579::$$$message_0072_0022_0001$$$::After all, this is my own classroom that I'm familiar with.[lr]::
9580::$$$message_0072_0022_0002$$$::As long as I'm here, no one is my enemy, whether it's Tohsaka, or the double power sisters duo, or the maid duo with unknown intentions.[lr]::
9581::$$$message_0072_0022_0003$$$::Let's see, if you ask me how much my fighting strength will go up, I can somehow make it at least neck and neck.::
9582::$$$message_0072_0023_0000$$$::"...Now."[lr]::
9583::$$$message_0072_0023_0001$$$::I sit at my seat and take a breath.[lr]::
9584::$$$message_0072_0023_0002$$$::Once I calm down, I'll leave the classroom and have lunch at the deserted kyudo club...[lr]::
9585::$$$message_0072_0023_0003$$$::...What's their problem?::
9586::$$$message_0072_0024_0000$$$::"Hello? What are you guys doing there?"[lr]::
9587::$$$message_0072_0024_0001$$$::I kick the desk and ask.[lr]::
9588::$$$message_0072_0024_0002$$$::"...That is odd. Are you not going to look for a recorder from a female student's desk?"[lr]::
9589::$$$message_0072_0024_0003$$$::"Why would I look for such a thing!?"[lr]::
9590::$$$message_0072_0024_0004$$$::The maid in blue clicks her tongue.::
9591::$$$message_0072_0025_0000$$$::"...I wonder why. An adolescent boy is coming to school on a weekend.[cacheimage storage=セラ01e(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=セラ01e(遠)] That should be the only objective there is."[lr]::
9592::$$$message_0072_0025_0001$$$::"Ugh, where did you get such knowledge? You should cast aside such a wrong way of thinking."::
9593::$$$message_0072_0026_0000$$$::"Wrong...?[cacheimage storage=セラ01a(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=200 textoff=0 storage=セラ01a(遠)] However, among the books that Leysritt purchased, there was such a depiction in about a third of the books..."[lr]::
9594::$$$message_0072_0026_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
9595::$$$message_0072_0026_0002$$$::It's devastatingly wrong.[lr]::
9596::$$$message_0072_0026_0003$$$::There is no common sense in that thing that Leys bought.::
9597::$$$message_0072_0027_0000$$$::"...Understood. So it is wrong to get sexually aroused by a close female student's instrument.[lr]::
9598::$$$message_0072_0027_0001$$$::...That is unfortunate. I was slightly impressed in the preference to favor an instrument itself, rather than a female student's body."[lr]::
9599::$$$message_0072_0027_0002$$$::Sella drops her shoulders in disappointment.[lr]::
9600::$$$message_0072_0027_0003$$$::Leys has been staring at my lunch the whole time.::
9601::$$$message_0072_0028_0000$$$::"...Um. If you don't have any business here, can you go somewhere else?"[lr]::
9602::$$$message_0072_0028_0001$$$::I came to school to take it easy, let me rest for a bit.::
9603::$$$message_0072_0029_0000$$$::"No, please do not mind us. We are just observing your school life. Please spend your weekend as you usually do. Such as looking through a female student's locker, wallowing in your imagination at your favorite female student's desk, and so on."[lr]::
9604::$$$message_0072_0029_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
9605::$$$message_0072_0029_0002$$$::In conclusion.[lr]::
9606::$$$message_0072_0029_0003$$$::If I don't escape from these two, a peaceful morning will not come.::
9607::$$$message_0072_0030_0000$$$::"All right."[wvs][shock vmax=20 time=800 count=2][se storage=se308.wav][lr]::
9608::$$$message_0072_0030_0001$$$::I get up.[lr]::
9609::$$$message_0072_0030_0002$$$::"Master Emiya? Are you going to look for a recorder after all?"[lr]::
9610::$$$message_0072_0030_0003$$$::"Oh, Fleur's monster-class extra-large jumbo strawberry cake in the schoolyard!?"::
9611::$$$message_0072_0031_0000$$$::"Monster-class extra-large cake...!? [wvl][move textoff=0 time=120 path=(306,93,255)(306,74,255)(306,99,255)(306,75,255) storage=セラ01f(近) accel=0]Could it be the legendary creature that attacked the town of Athens!?"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
9612::$$$message_0072_0031_0001$$$::Sella runs to the window, and Leys is still staring at my lunch the whole time.::
9613::$$$message_0072_0032_0000$$$::"Where![wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=15 time=400 count=3] Where is it, Master Emiya!?[lr]::
9614::$$$message_0072_0032_0001$$$::To be called jumbo,[movefg opacity=0 left=282 top=65 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートa textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=281 top=56 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートb textoff=0][cacheimage storage=ハートa,ハートb][wvl] it needs to be at least 10 meters in diameter or more;[movefg opacity=255 left=282 top=75 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートa textoff=0][movefg opacity=0 left=281 top=56 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートb textoff=0][cacheimage storage=ハートa,ハートb][wvl] otherwise, it would be misleading.[movefg opacity=0 left=282 top=75 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートa textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=281 top=56 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートb textoff=0][cacheimage storage=ハートa,ハートb][wvl] Moreover, the whipped cream,[movefg opacity=255 left=282 top=75 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートa textoff=0][movefg opacity=0 left=281 top=56 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートb textoff=0][cacheimage storage=ハートa,ハートb][wvl] without any ingenuity or flair,[movefg opacity=0 left=282 top=75 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートa textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=281 top=56 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートb textoff=0][cacheimage storage=ハートa,ハートb][wvl] is a copy-paste job that goes on and on, like rushed work.[movefg opacity=255 left=282 top=75 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートa textoff=0][movefg opacity=0 left=281 top=56 time=300 accel=0 storage=ハートb textoff=0][cacheimage storage=ハートa,ハートb][wvl] Even the defense of 'symmetry' won't hold up[line len=2][movefg opacity=0 left=282 top=75 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートa textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=281 top=56 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートb textoff=0][cacheimage storage=ハートa,ハートb,きゃー文字][wvl]it's the ultimate instant product![movefg opacity=255 left=282 top=75 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートa textoff=0][movefg opacity=0 left=281 top=56 time=100 accel=0 storage=ハートb textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=454 top=184 time=10 accel=0 storage=きゃー文字 textoff=0][lr]::
9615::$$$message_0072_0032_0002$$$::...Ahh, I feel like one's magecraft foundation will collapse just from imagining that such a vulgar cake of bad taste exists!"::
9616::$$$message_0072_0033_0000$$$::Sella squeals in delight.[lr]::
9617::$$$message_0072_0033_0001$$$::...Um, so. There might be some major defect in the Einzbern's magecraft foundation.::
9618::$$$message_0072_0034_0000$$$::"Huh!? Leys, where did Master Emiya go!?"[lr]::
9619::$$$message_0072_0034_0001$$$::"Hallway. Ran away like an idiot."[lr]::
9620::$$$message_0072_0034_0002$$$::"Could it be that was his intent...!?[lr]::
9621::$$$message_0072_0034_0003$$$::Khh, how ingenious...![cacheimage storage=セラ02e(遠)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=セラ02e(遠)] We shall go after him, Leysritt! We cannot let him go!"::
9622::$$$message_0072_0035_0000$$$::"...Did I do something wrong?"[lr]::
9623::$$$message_0072_0035_0001$$$::I don't recall anything, but as long as I'm being chased, I have to run.[lr]::
9624::$$$message_0072_0035_0002$$$::Fortunately, this is school and not the castle. I can easily shake off Sella and Leys who are unfamiliar with the school grounds...::
9625::$$$message_0072_0036_0000$$$::"...Phew."[lr]::
9626::$$$message_0072_0036_0001$$$::I steady my breathing and wipe the sweat off my forehead.[lr]::
9627::$$$message_0072_0036_0002$$$::I go around the clubroom building and auditorium, and take refuge in the archery range in the end.::
9628::$$$message_0072_0037_0000$$$::Although I completely shook off the pursuing party, it's almost noon...[lr]::
9629::$$$message_0072_0037_0001$$$::"Yup. Shirou, welcome back."[lr]::
9630::$$$message_0072_0037_0002$$$::Leys was waiting at the archery range for me.::
9631::$$$message_0072_0038_0000$$$::"I-I caught up to you... Haah...[wvl canskip=0 time=400]haah... [wvl canskip=0 time=400]M-[wvl canskip=0 time=400]Master Emiya, please...[wvl canskip=0 time=400]do...[wvl canskip=0 time=400]not...[wvl canskip=0 time=400]mind...[wvl canskip=0 time=400]us."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
9632::$$$message_0072_0038_0001$$$::Sella comes, gasping for breath.[lr]::
9633::$$$message_0072_0038_0002$$$::I hear that she is quite unathletic, but she's got quite some stamina to follow me all the way here. She must have some guts.[lr]::
9634::$$$message_0072_0038_0003$$$::...Something's wrong with the Einzbern's magecraft foundation after all.::
9635::$$$message_0072_0039_0000$$$::"...Fine. I give up. I'll eat lunch obediently. I'll share some with you two, so give me a break."[lr]::
9636::$$$message_0072_0039_0001$$$::...I see.[lr]::
9637::$$$message_0072_0039_0002$$$::Sella aside, I could've given Leys my lunch.::
9638::$$$message_0072_0040_0000$$$::"Yes, [wvl canskip=0 time=30]you're right...[wvl canskip=0 time=300]haah... I...[wvl canskip=0 time=300]also...would like to...[wvl canskip=0 time=300]get some nutrients. [wvl canskip=0 time=300]By researching...[wvl canskip=0 time=300]Master Emiya's food...[wvl canskip=0 time=300]we shall finish up...[wvl canskip=0 time=300]haah...[wvl canskip=0 time=300]our...[wvl canskip=0 time=300]haah...[wvl canskip=0 time=300]investigation."[lr]::
9639::$$$message_0072_0040_0001$$$::Sella wobbles to my lunch and flops onto the floor.::
9640::$$$message_0072_0041_0000$$$::"Sella, don't hog.[lr]::
9641::$$$message_0072_0041_0001$$$::Need to share Shirou's between us."[lr]::
9642::$$$message_0072_0041_0002$$$::And it seems that for Leys, there's none for me.::
9643::$$$message_0072_0042_0000$$$::"...Well, if you'll let me go, then that's fine."[lr]::
9644::$$$message_0072_0042_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Um, so.[font italic=false][lr]::
9645::$$$message_0072_0042_0002$$$::[font italic=true]What were these people even doing?[font italic=false]::
909543::$$$message_9072_0012_0001$$$::I can't tell if those two get along or not, but it's clear that they are amusing people.[r]::

